---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="ADHD Treatment Towson, MD | Mind Menders | Matthew Mauro PMHNP-BC"
  description="Expert ADHD evaluation and medication management for children, adolescents, and adults in Towson, MD. Matthew Mauro, PMHNP-BC. In-person and telehealth."
  activeNav="services"
>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/services">Services</a> &rsaquo; <span>ADHD</span></nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-white">Condition</span>
    <h1>ADHD Treatment for All Ages</h1>
    <p>Comprehensive evaluation and evidence-based medication management for attention deficit hyperactivity disorder in children, adolescents, and adults. Clear diagnosis. Personalized care.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About ADHD</span>
        <h2>Understanding Attention Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder</h2>
        <p>ADHD is one of the most common neurodevelopmental conditions, affecting children and adults alike. It is characterized by persistent patterns of inattention, hyperactivity, and impulsivity that interfere with daily functioning, academic performance, work, and relationships.</p>
        <p>ADHD often goes undiagnosed or misdiagnosed, particularly in girls and adults, and it can co-exist with anxiety, depression, learning differences, and autism spectrum disorder. A thorough psychiatric evaluation is essential to accurate diagnosis and effective treatment.</p>
        <p>At Mind Menders, Matthew Mauro has extensive experience evaluating and managing ADHD across the entire lifespan &mdash; from young children to adults. He takes the time to understand the full clinical picture before making any recommendations.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:var(--sp-4)">Schedule an Evaluation &#8594;</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="background:var(--teal-light);border-radius:var(--radius-xl);padding:var(--sp-8);border:1px solid var(--border)">
          <span class="eyebrow">Common Signs</span>
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)">Recognizing ADHD Symptoms</h3>
          <div class="condition-signs">
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Difficulty sustaining attention on tasks</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Easily distracted by unrelated stimuli</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Frequent forgetfulness in daily activities</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Fidgeting, squirming, or leaving seat</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Difficulty waiting or taking turns</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Talking excessively or interrupting</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Poor time management &amp; organization</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Difficulty completing tasks or projects</p></div>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:var(--sp-4)">Symptoms must be present in multiple settings and cause significant functional impairment. A formal evaluation is required for diagnosis.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px">
    <div class="section-header center"><span class="eyebrow">Treatment</span><h2>Our Approach to ADHD Care</h2></div>
    <div class="treatment-list">
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#128065;</div><div><h4>Comprehensive Evaluation</h4><p>A thorough psychiatric assessment including symptom history, developmental and family history, rating scales, and ruling out co-occurring conditions. Matthew takes the time to truly understand your full clinical picture.</p></div></div>
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#128138;</div><div><h4>Medication Management</h4><p>Evidence-based pharmacotherapy including stimulant and non-stimulant options, carefully selected and monitored based on your individual needs, health history, and response to treatment.</p></div></div>
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#128172;</div><div><h4>Behavioral Strategies &amp; Psychoeducation</h4><p>Understanding ADHD is half the battle. Matthew provides education about how ADHD affects your brain and practical strategies for managing symptoms in daily life.</p></div></div>
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#128200;</div><div><h4>Ongoing Follow-Up</h4><p>Regular check-ins to monitor medication effectiveness, adjust dosages as needed, and ensure treatment continues to support your functioning and quality of life.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Get an ADHD Evaluation</h2>
    <p>New patients welcome. In-person in Towson or via telehealth throughout Maryland.</p>
    <div class="cta-phone"><a href="tel:4437987707">(443) 798-7707</a></div>
    <div class="cta-actions"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Request Appointment</a><a href="/services" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg">All Services</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
